<title>JAPAN: Japan six-year JGB auction lowest price of 99.30.</title>
<headline>Japan six-year JGB auction lowest price of 99.30.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Ministry of Finance (MOF) said that its auction on Tuesday of 500 billion yen of six-year government bonds produced the following results:</p>
<p>Lowest price	 99.30    Stop rate	   1.728 pct</p>
<p>Average price	99.44    Average yield     1.702 pct</p>
<p>Total bids	   1.1432 trillion yen</p>
<p>Accepted Bids	499.7 billion yen</p>
<p>Bids accepted at lowest price 20.3219 pct Issue date    March 21, 1997   Maturity    March 20, 2003</p>
